 colspan="1">T<sub>max</sub></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.43 h</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.38 day</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.4 day</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.1 day</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Half-life</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.74 h</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22 days</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25.5 day</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AUC</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16.51 ng.mL<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>.h</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">79.48 ng.mL<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>.day</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">116 ng.mL<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>.day</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">133 ng.mL<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>.day</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MRT</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.95 h</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.97 days</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-btt-2-463"><p><sup>a</sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b11-btt-2-463">Antonijoan et al (2004)</xref>;</p></fn><fn id="tfn2-btt-2-463"><p><sup>b</sup><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b13-btt-2-463">Astruc et al (2005)</xref>.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-btt-2-463" fn-type="abbr"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> AUC, area under the curve; MRT, mean residence time.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-btt-2-463" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Pharmacokinetics of lanreotide Autogel<sup>&#x000ae;</sup> during steady state conditions in patients with acromegaly</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Dose</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">60 mg</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">90 mg</th><th align=